{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10374","headline":"同羣公出猎海上 · 高适","name":"同羣公出猎海上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"畋猎自古昔，况伊心赏俱。\n偶与羣公游，旷然出平芜。\n层阴涨溟海，杀气穷幽都。\n鹰隼何翩翩，驰骤相传呼。\n豺狼窜榛莽，麋鹿罹艰虞。\n高鸟下騂弓，困兽鬬匹夫。\n尘惊大泽晦，火燎深林枯。\n失之有余恨，获者无全躯。\n咄彼工拙间，恨非指踪徒。\n犹怀老氏训，感叹此欢娱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}